{
  "name": "Meta Threads Viral Posts, Keyword Search & Creator Profile Extractor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Meta Threads Viral Posts, Keyword Search & Creator Profile Extractor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nMonitor emerging B2B and creator conversations on Meta Threads and extract high-engagement posts and author profiles.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/meta-threads-posts-profiles-search-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/meta-threads-posts-profiles-search-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Threads Scraper — Posts, Profiles & Search** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "37c4dd6f-279d-4914-ad69-42c76dde23df",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Threads Scraper — Posts, Profiles & Search** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "17b3d403-b7c5-421f-a471-8abe2f043a9b",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "3971f4ff-1f85-464a-aceb-acfb6bb7cec0",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "7ceab938-3ea9-4ef7-a36d-54a7749bc7d6",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
